039;m helping plan a&amp;nbsp;wedding&amp;nbsp;and I have to find a &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.idodressau.com\/mother-of-the-bride-dresses\/&#039;&gt;mother of the bride dress online&lt;\/a&gt;, please help with suggesting stores, it will be a spring wedding held outdoors in the&amp;nbsp;afternoon, and the mother of the bride is plus size.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Thank you&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906810,"PostDate":1445806096,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\">I'm helping plan a\u00a0wedding\u00a0and I have to find a <a href='http:\/\/www.idodressau.com\/mother-of-the-bride-dresses\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>mother of the bride dress online<\/a>, please help with suggesting stores, it will be a spring wedding held outdoors in the\u00a0afternoon, and the mother of the bride is plus size.\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\">Thank you<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adelaidepan2012@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"45.34.81.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441571326,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Amandajone","Id":284703,"Name":"Amandajone","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79679,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b24c0b1dc585cc84825bb42a1c32216a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Have you tried David&#039;s Bridal? I know that may be a cliche but they really do have some nice styles for MOB and can go up to I think about a 22 or 24. I don&#039;t know what the budget is but there is also the Dessy Group website. They do both bridesmaids and moms if I remember correctly. I think if you find any local bridal store that has a website you&#039;ll be able to see what the store has.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906868,"PostDate":1445975814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have you tried David's Bridal? I know that may be a cliche but they really do have some nice styles for MOB and can go up to I think about a 22 or 24. I don't know what the budget is but there is also the Dessy Group website. They do both bridesmaids and moms if I remember correctly. I think if you find any local bridal store that has a website you'll be able to see what the store has.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'